{
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "bosc:provenance": {
    "subject": "The US-68 S / SR-730 data-center corridor, Union Township / City of Wilmington, Clinton County OH (FIPS 39027) \u2014 SEVEN contiguous auditor parcels, 1,023.764 ac deeded / 1023.786 ac planar, in TWO legally distinct groups: the three parcels deeded to AMAZON DATA SERVICES INC (the ~471-ac former Cosler Farm campus tract at 1488 S US 68 plus two right-of-way strips) and the four tracts rezoned by City ordinances O-26-04 \u2013 O-26-07 for the second, Ardent/TAC campus, which remain in their original owners' names. #1470, sub-issue of #1277.",
    "source": "Clinton County GIS Department ArcGIS Online org (tAhcHWpOD9ygNPbJ) \u2014 cntyparcelsRealPropData_gdb FeatureServer layer 0 (Clinton County Auditor CAMA join + geometry), tax year 2025, Extract_ID 1135, read through the new clinton_gis connector (CLINTON_PARCEL_SCHEMA)",
    "source_url": "https://services1.arcgis.com/tAhcHWpOD9ygNPbJ/arcgis/rest/services/cntyparcelsRealPropData_gdb/FeatureServer/0",
    "read": "2026-08-01",
